  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 29 October 2026 at 4:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPositioned in sought-after Murrays Bay, this is a rare opportunity to secure a substantial freehold site of approximately 1,267sqm, complemented by a spacious family home of approximately 200m².\r\n\r\nZoned for Murrays Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Rangitoto College (subject to confirmation), this property combines sought-after schooling with the space and flexibility that are increasingly hard to find on the North Shore.\r\n\r\nA superb opportunity for families, land seekers and astute buyers looking to secure a sizeable landholding in a premium coastal location.\r\n\r\nBig land. Top school zones. Endless possibilities.\r\n\r\nContact us today to find out more.",
